  <description>
    <p>
      OmniSec ULTIMATE is a complete, offline-first cybersecurity platform.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>161 integrated security tools in one unified interface</li>
      <li>AI Copilot with local LLM (no cloud, no telemetry)</li>
      <li>Post-quantum cryptography (Kyber, Dilithium, SPHINCS+)</li>
      <li>Mesh networking for operation without internet</li>
      <li>Network scanning, vulnerability assessment, and exploitation</li>
      <li>Password auditing and hash cracking</li>
      <li>OSINT reconnaissance and social engineering</li>
      <li>Forensic analysis and timeline reconstruction</li>
      <li>Automated report generation with compliance templates</li>
      <li>100% offline — Zero cloud, zero telemetry, maximum privacy</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
